{"sha": "74de8ea7120f65ee71c813f4d20dd906548259033e0641c40578b02c2d5c07a5", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g12:diffeq} 章 --- 微分方程}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:diffeq:1}", "\\emph{(a)} 由 $y = C\\eu^{3x}$；$y(0) = 2$ 得 $y = 2\\eu^{3x}$。", "", "\\emph{(b)} $y' = -\\frac12 y$，于是 $y = C\\eu^{-x/2}$；$y(0) = -1$ 得", "$y = -\\eu^{-x/2}$。", "", "\\emph{(c)} 平衡解 $y_p = 5$；$y = C\\eu^{-x} + 5$；$y(0) = 0$ 得", "$C = -5$：$y = 5\\left(1 - \\eu^{-x}\\right)$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:diffeq:2}", "$N' = kN$，故 $N(t) = N_0 \\eu^{kt}$。经过 $3$ 小时数量加倍，即", "$\\eu^{3k} = 2$，\\emph{即}", "\\[", "k = \\frac{\\ln 2}{3} \\approx 0.231\\ \\text{h}^{-1}.", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:diffeq:3}", "$y_p'(x) = \\eu^x + x\\eu^x = y_p(x) + \\eu^x$：$y_p$ 是一个特解", "（这正是 \\cref{met:g12:diffeq:particular} 所述的共振情形）。由", "\\cref{prop:g12:diffeq:general}，方程的解为", "$y = C\\eu^{x} + x\\eu^{x} = (C + x)\\,\\eu^x$，$C \\in \\R$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:diffeq:4}", "试取 $y_p = \\beta\\eu^x$：$\\beta\\eu^x = -2\\beta\\eu^x + \\eu^x$ 得", "$3\\beta = 1$，于是 $y_p = \\frac13\\eu^x$。通解", "为 $y = C\\eu^{-2x} + \\frac13\\eu^{x}$；由条件 $y(0) = 1$ 得", "$C = \\frac23$：", "\\[", "y(x) = \\frac{2}{3}\\,\\eu^{-2x} + \\frac{1}{3}\\,\\eu^{x}.", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:diffeq:5}", "$N(t) = N_0\\,\\eu^{-\\lambda t}$，其中 $\\lambda = \\frac{\\ln 2}{5730}$", "（见\\cref{ex:g12:exp:halflife}）。解方程 $\\eu^{-\\lambda t} = 0.6$：", "\\[", "t = \\frac{\\ln(1/0.6)}{\\lambda} = 5730\\,\\frac{\\ln(5/3)}{\\ln 2}", "\\approx 5730 \\times \\frac{0.5108}{0.6931} \\approx 4220 \\text{ 年}.", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:diffeq:6}", "\\emph{1.} 盐的流入速率为 $0.2 \\times 5 = 1$ kg/min。流出液", "的浓度为 $\\frac{m}{100}$ kg/L，流出速率为 $5$ L/min，\\emph{即} $\\frac{m}{20}$", "kg/min。于是 $m' = 1 - \\frac{m}{20}$。", "", "\\emph{2.} 平衡解 $m_p = 20$；$m(t) = 20 + C\\eu^{-t/20}$，且", "$m(0) = 0$ 得 $C = -20$：", "\\[", "m(t) = 20\\left(1 - \\eu^{-t/20}\\right) \\xrightarrow[t\\to+\\infty]{} 20 \\text{ kg}.", "\\]", "长期来看，水箱中的浓度与流入盐水的浓度相等：", "$0.2$ kg/L $\\times$ $100$ L $= 20$ kg。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:diffeq:7}", "\\emph{1.} $v' = g - \\frac{k}{m} v$，其中 $\\frac km = \\frac{16}{80} = 0.2$。", "平衡解 $v_\\infty = \\frac{mg}{k} = \\frac{9.8}{0.2} = 49$ m/s；", "$v(t) = 49 + C\\eu^{-0.2t}$，由 $v(0) = 0$ 得", "\\[", "v(t) = 49\\left(1 - \\eu^{-0.2 t}\\right).", "\\]", "", "\\emph{2.} 终速度为 $49$ m/s（$\\approx 176$ km/h）。要使", "$1 - \\eu^{-0.2t} = 0.95$，\\emph{即} $\\eu^{-0.2t} = 0.05$：", "\\[", "t = \\frac{\\ln 20}{0.2} \\approx \\frac{3.00}{0.2} \\approx 15 \\text{ s}.", "\\]", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:diffeq:8}", "\\emph{1.} 令 $z = \\frac1y$，则 $z' = -\\frac{y'}{y^2}", "= -\\frac{y(1-y)}{y^2} = -\\frac{1-y}{y} = -\\frac1y + 1 = -z + 1$。", "", "\\emph{2.} 平衡解 $z_p = 1$，故 $z(t) = 1 + C\\eu^{-t}$。由", "$y(0) = \\frac{1}{10}$，$z(0) = 10$，于是 $C = 9$，且", "\\[", "y(t) = \\frac{1}{1 + 9\\,\\eu^{-t}} .", "\\]", "", "\\emph{3.} 当 $t \\to +\\infty$ 时，$9\\eu^{-t} \\to 0$，$y(t) \\to 1$。", "曲线为经典的 S 形（\\emph{sigmoid}）逻辑斯谛曲线：起初增长缓慢", "（$y$ 较小，$y' \\approx y$），增长最快出现在 $y = \\frac12$ 时", "（此时 $y' = y(1-y)$ 最大），随后逐渐饱和，", "趋向环境容纳量 $1$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g12:diffeq:9}", "由\\cref{thm:g12:diffeq:affine}，$y(x) = C\\eu^{ax} - \\frac ba$。于是", "\\[", "u_{n+1} = C\\eu^{a(n+1)} - \\frac ba", "= \\eu^{a}\\left(C\\eu^{an} - \\frac ba\\right) + \\frac ba\\left(\\eu^a - 1\\right)", "= q\\,u_n + r", "\\]", "其中 $q = \\eu^{a}$，$r = \\frac{b}{a}\\left(\\eu^{a} - 1\\right)$。", "条件 $\\abs q < 1$ 等价于 $\\eu^a < 1$，\\emph{即} $a < 0$：这恰是使", "微分方程的解收敛于平衡解", "$-\\frac ba$ 的条件 --- 事实上，递推关系的不动点", "为 $\\frac{r}{1 - q} = -\\frac{b}{a}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:g12:diffeq:1}", "\\textbf{1.} $y = 2\\eu^{3t}$。第二小题的平衡解为 $3$，", "故 $y = 3 + C\\eu^{-2t}$，由 $y(0) = 0$ 得 $C = -3$：", "$y = 3\\left(1 - \\eu^{-2t}\\right)$。", ""]}